{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12214170","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12214170","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1221417001:1":{"text":"칼, 잘 들어. 이게 내 마지막 수업이야.","source_cn":"卡尔，听好，这是我教给你的最后一课。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFBDFBAD9E4794822","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1221417002:1":{"text":"마지막 수업은… 함부로 다른 사람에게 별명을 지어주지 마! 내 이름은 치피라고!","source_cn":"最后一课就是……不要给别人乱起外号啊！我叫满满！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x96F454FC7CD4DA6F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1221417003:1":{"text":"죄송해요! 햄스, 아니! 치피 선생님!","source_cn":"对不起！仓、啊不！满满老师！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x984EA0DD4AF5E8A4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1221417004:1":{"text":"칼, 이건 조금 전에 레시피를 판 돈이야. “싸움 선생님”의 성의라고 생각하고 받아 둬.","source_cn":"卡尔，这是刚才卖掉配方的钱，拿着吧，就当是我作为“战斗...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5F62F281FE5877BD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1221417005:1":{"text":"아니에요! 전 선생님의 가르침에 수업료도 내지 못했는걸요! 이 돈은 절대 받을 수 없어요!","source_cn":"不！老师教我变强，我还没付学费，我不能收钱！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4EC8CE819797A637","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1221417006:1":{"text":"그냥 받으라는 게 아니라, 이 돈으로 더 강한 선생님을 찾아가서 전투 기술을 연마하고, 가족과 친구를 지키라는 뜻이야.","source_cn":"并不是白白让你收下，你要好好利用这些钱，去拜访更强的老...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF0DE7E78E21CBEEA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1221417007:1":{"text":"칼은 앞으로 더 자신감 있고, 강하고, 용감해져야 해, 바로 이 치피님처럼 말이야. 할 수 있지?","source_cn":"你还要变得自信、坚强、勇敢，像满满我一样。怎么样，可以...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x05C3D376B614DB7B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1221417008:1":{"text":"…당연하죠! 자신 있어요!","source_cn":"……那是当然！我、我有这个信心！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x389685D1EF33DA05","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1221417009:1":{"text":"좋아, 그럼, 이쯤에서 작별하자구!","source_cn":"很好，那么，我们该告别了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC5414277DA973D7B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1221417010:0":{"text":"흑흑… 햄스터 선생님의 말씀을 꼭 기억할게요!","source_cn":"呜呜……我会记住您的话，仓鼠老师！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x956FF588E54AE5B2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1221417011:1":{"text":"기억은 무슨! 내 이름은 치피라고 말해 줬잖아!","source_cn":"我看你根本就没记住！我叫满满！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD7C09F0924D57980","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1221417012:1":{"text":"칼, 계속해서 노력하도록. 그럼, 안녕!","source_cn":"卡尔，你可要继续努力，再见啦！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFDA3BB5BF05B9D82","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:卡尔":{"text":"칼","source":"卡尔","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":13,"localized_text_count":12,"speaker_count":2}}